(7810296, 1304004, 98565, '<td valign="top">
It was my highest vote and I absolutely adore how you created it. Was the clothing and the pose of your young model your idea? Together with the editing it results in a super powerful image. I don''t think of notalgia or future when looking at it, I can sense a feeling of not belonging of that young person, struggling with growing up, being different than the classmates and the neighbour kids. Reminds me somehow of the book "wonder" by Raquel J. Palacio<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2026-02-20 12:24:15.</i></td>', 'It was my highest vote and I absolutely adore how you created it. Was the clothing and the pose of your young model your idea? Together with the editing it results in a super powerful image. I don''t think of notalgia or future when looking at it, I can sense a feeling of not belonging of that young person, struggling with growing up, being different than the classmates and the neighbour kids. Reminds me somehow of the book "wonder" by Raquel J. Palacio', '2026-02-20 12:23:38.000000', '2026-02-20 12:24:15.000000', 0),
